**D4.** `docs:mcp` placeholder exits 0 (T01) so `pnpm lint`… wait, `lint` doesn'"'t call docs:mcp; T26 adds the docs:mcp+diff check to the CI "'`lint` *job* (CI yaml), not the root script — root `pnpm verify` never regenerates docs; T42 acceptance runs `pnpm docs:mcp && git diff --exit-code` manually ✔ consistent.

